{"id":"hinauf","lemma":"hinauf","pos":"adv","rank":3709,"glosses":["up; upward; upwards (from the own location upwards, in direction away from the speaker)"],"ipa":"/hɪˈnaʊ̯f/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/84/De-hinauf.ogg/De-hinauf.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Geh die Treppe hinauf.","en":"Go up the stairs.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/250236","words":[{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"stairs"},null]},{"text":"Sie sah zum Himmel hinauf.","en":"She looked up at the sky.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"sky"},null]},{"text":"Geh da nicht hinauf.","en":"Don't go up there.","words":[{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Sie ging schnell die Treppe hinauf.","en":"She quickly went up the stairs.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"quickly"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"stairs"},null]},{"text":"Der Lehrer lief die Treppe hinauf.","en":"The teacher ran up the stairs.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"to teach","l":"lehren"},{"g":"to walk","l":"laufen"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"stairs"},null]}]}